# Shared by BOTH builds (deploy/Dockerfile = bot, deploy/fbgb-headless/Dockerfile =
# Facebook reader); the Pi's Docker has no BuildKit, so per-Dockerfile ignore files
# are not an option. Never exclude a package one of the images COPYs.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
out/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.log
*.jsonl
codedb.snapshot
copilot-session-*.md
archive/
tests/
.playwright-mcp/
.pytest_cache/
# facebook_generic_browser: docs/samples only (explore/ is runtime code for fbgb login/validate)
aptbot/scrapers/facebook_generic_browser/api_docs/
aptbot/scrapers/facebook_generic_browser/docs/
aptbot/scrapers/facebook_generic_browser/examples/
aptbot/scrapers/facebook_generic_browser/out/
# ChatGPT OAuth token store (aptbot/listing_ai); it lives outside the repo, never in an image
**/.aptbot/
**/chatgpt-auth.json*
